\par\par \uc2 Australia news\par \b \uc2 Morning Mail: Hawaii wildfires declared major disaster, activist says police pulled gun on him, World Cup fever grows\b0\par\par\uc2 Paul Gallagher \par \uc2 1,087 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 August 2023\par 20:53 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Want to get this in your inbox every weekday? Sign up for the Morning Mail here, and finish your day with our Afternoon Update newsletter\par \par \uc2 Good morning. Devastating wildfires in Hawaii have been declared a major disaster after at least 36 people were killed as a blaze engulfed the historic town of Lahaina. US officials are warning that the death toll may rise further still with desperate searches for survivors and mass evacuations underway.\par \par \uc2 Back home, a climate activist from the Disrupt Burrup Hub group claims he was pulled over at gunpoint by Western Australian police \u8211\'20\'13 the day before he was charged over a protest at the City Beach home of the \uc2 Woodside\uc2  chief executive \uc2 Meg O\u8217\'20\'19Neill\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 And World Cup fever has well and truly taken hold across Australia \u8211\'20\'13 and may help pave the way for a future generation of footballing stars.\par \par \uc2 Australia\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Firearm drawn |\par \par \uc2 A Western Australian climate activist (pictured) charged over \uc2 Woodside\uc2  protest says {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2023/aug/11/wa-activist-charged-over-woodside-protest-says-police-pointed-gun-at-him-day-before"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 police pulled him over at gunpoint}}}\uc2  the day before, in an incident expected to be reviewed by police authorities.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Empty shelves |\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2023/aug/11/childrens-medicines-in-short-supply-across-australia-as-cold-and-flu-cases-continue-to-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Parents are struggling to find medicines for their children}}}\uc2  as cold and flu cases continue to rise this winter, with supplies of children\u8217\'20\'19s antibiotics and painkillers particularly in short supply.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Revisit the writing tone\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 |\par \par \uc2 Home Affairs officials told researchers to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2023/aug/11/home-affairs-tried-to-water-down-report-critical-of-extraordinary-counter-terror-powers-documents-reveal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 water down a key report}}}\uc2  that threatened to undermine the government\u8217\'20\'19s use of \u8220\'20\'1Cextraordinary\u8221\'20\'1D counter-terror powers, documents show.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Homes for the vulnerable\par \par \uc2 |\par \par \uc2 New South Wales housing minister Rose Jackson concedes that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2023/aug/11/nsw-minister-concedes-social-housing-situation-desperate-as-waitlist-for-most-in-need-doubles-in-a-decade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the social housing situation is \u8220\'20\'1Cdesperate\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  as the waitlist for those most in need doubles in a decade.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The Marinus Link |\par \par \uc2 The future looks shaky for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2023/aug/11/marinus-link-future-uncertain-for-key-tasmania-to-mainland-power-transmission-link-after-2bn-cost-blowout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a key Tasmania-to-mainland power transmission project}}}\uc2  following a $2bn cost blowout, amid fears the uncertainty may effect the fate of other major energy projects.\par \par \uc2 World\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Russia-Ukraine war |\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/aug/10/ukraine-forces-capture-parts-of-bakhmut-from-russian-forces-kyiv-claims"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ukrainian forces have made gains}}}\uc2  and are encircling Russian troops in Bakhmut, says Kyiv; minister vows to act over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/aug/10/ukraine-minister-vows-to-act-over-claims-of-sexual-harassment-in-army"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claims of sexual harassment in Ukraine\u8217\'20\'19s army}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Hawaii wildfires |\par \par \uc2 Emergency crews are mounting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/aug/10/hawaii-fire-kills-people-lahaina-town-maui"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 desperate searches for survivors in Maui}}}\uc2  after at least 36 people died in ferocious wildfires that have ravaged the historic town of Lahaina.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 There and back again |\par \par \uc2 Virgin Galactic\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s reusable rocket-powered space plane has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/science/2023/aug/10/vigin-galactic-space-flight-vss-unity-landing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 successfully flown tourists to space for first time}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 including the first mother-daughter duo to venture to space together.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18You have divided Manipur\u8217\'20\'19 |\par \par \uc2 Opposition parties have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/aug/10/indian-opposition-walks-out-as-narendra-modi-refuses-to-discuss-manipur-conflict"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 walked out of the Indian parliament}}}\uc2  in protest at the refusal of the prime minister, \uc2 Narendra Modi\uc2 , to address {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/aug/10/manipur-conflict-narendra-modi-opposition-india"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ethnic violence in the state of Manipur}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18It is simply not true\u8217\'20\'19 |\par \par \uc2 Kristin Harila has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/aug/10/record-speed-mountaineer-denies-climbing-over-dying-sherpa-on-k2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denied that her team climbed over a dying sherpa}}}\uc2  to reach the summit of K2 in her bid to become the world\u8217\'20\'19s fastest climber to scale all peaks above 8,000m.\par \par \uc2 Full Story\par \par \uc2 Newsroom edition: nuclear power and \uc2 Peter Dutton\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s politics of diversion\par \par \uc2 Peter Dutton\uc2  is ramping up his calls for nuclear power in Australia. The opposition leader is now saying nuclear energy is a safe, cheap and consistent power source, which will help Australia transition from fossil fuels towards a zero emissions economy. But his claims are not backed up by the facts. Gabrielle Jackson speaks to Lenore Taylor and Mike Ticher about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/audio/2023/aug/11/newsroom-edition-nuclear-power-and-peter-duttons-politics-of-diversion-full-story-podcast"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 why nuclear power is not the answer to our energy transition}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In-depth\par \par \uc2 All around Australia, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/11/womens-world-cup-2023-matildas-australia-fans-fandom-tattoos-merchandise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 World Cup fever has taken hold as the public embrace the Matildas\u8217\'20\'19 bid for glory}}}\uc2 . The Fifa Women\u8217\'20\'19s World Cup co-hosts\u8217\'20\'19 team has captured public imagination, from tattoos to gingerbread and baby onesies. The emotional celebrations of the past few weeks have made Matildas players household names \u8211\'20\'13 and are prompting some girls ask their parents for extra football training. Plus: How well do you know the Matildas? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/11/womens-world-cup-2023-how-well-do-you-know-the-matildas-test-quiz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Test your knowledge in this quiz}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Not the news\par \par \uc2 Spanning 1933 to 2181, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2023/aug/11/the-hummingbird-effect-by-kate-mildenhall-review-a-genre-defying-epic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Hummingbird Effect is an ambitious novel exploring the future of humanity}}}\uc2  through the lives of a few women, zeroing in on capitalism, AI and violence. If this sounds like a lot, it is. But there is incredible ambition in the way that Kate Mildenhall (pictured) exerts herself as a writer in this genre-defying novel.\par \par \uc2 The world of sport\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Women\u8217\'20\'19s World Cup |\par \par \uc2 We {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/10/womens-world-cup-quarter-finals-predicting-the-final-four"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 preview the quarter-finals}}}\uc2  as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/10/womens-world-cup-quarter-finals-spain-netherlands-japan-sweden-france-australia-england-colombia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 readers give their takes }}}\uc2  ahead of kick off; the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2023/aug/11/womens-world-cup-2023-matildas-long-time-fan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Matildas are finally getting the attention they deserve}}}\uc2  ; England\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/10/lauren-james-gets-two-game-ban-clearing-her-for-final-if-england-get-there"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lauren James given two-match ban}}}\uc2  for stamp.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Football |\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/10/tottenham-accept-harry-kane-offer-bayern-munich"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Harry Kane ponders Bayern Munich move}}}\uc2  ; Manchester City\u8217\'20\'19s Pep Guardiola says {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2023/aug/10/pep-guardiola-says-it-is-impossible-for-manchester-city-to-repeat-last-seasons-treble"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it is impossible to repeat last season\u8217\'20\'19s treble}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Cycling |\par \par \uc2 American Chlo\u233\'00\'E9 Dygert beats Australian Grace Brown by six seconds to win {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2023/aug/10/chloe-dygert-world-title-comeback-time-trial-cycling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the elite women\u8217\'20\'19s road time trial}}}\uc2  at the UCI World Cycling Championships in Scotland.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Tennis |\par \par \uc2 In news just breaking, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2023/aug/10/nick-kyrgios-withdraws-us-open-injury-problems-continue-tennis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nick Kyrgios has pulled out of this month\u8217\'20\'19s US Open}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Media roundup\par \par \uc2 Australian company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theage.com.au/politics/federal/boats-stopped-the-money-didn-t-how-liberal-donor-made-442m-in-five-years-20230809-p5dv2v.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Canstruct was paid more than $300m}}}\uc2  by the federal government to care for refugees and asylum seekers on Nauru last financial year \u8211\'20\'13 even as the number of people on the island dwindled to a few dozen, reports the Age. The NSW government\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.smh.com.au/politics/nsw/gay-conversion-law-would-ban-suppression-of-gender-identity-20230808-p5dute.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plans to ban gay conversion therapy will be expanded}}}\uc2  to include making it illegal to change or suppress a person identifying as trans or gender diverse, reports the Sydney Morning Herald. Anthony Albanese will link lowering emissions with mitigating the risks of extreme drought, bushfires and storms as he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theaustralian.com.au/nation/politics/bush-summit-anthony-albaneses-pitch-as-fire-and-drought-risks-loom/news-story/55d2cf74fa5261862e1839112d33c254"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 makes an announcement on long-term drought resilience programs}}}\uc2 , says the Australian.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s happening today\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 ACT |\par \par \uc2 Public hearing scheduled for the inquiry into the Family Law Amendment Bill 2023.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Media |\par \par \uc2 News Corp\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s full-year fiscal 2023 results due to be released.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 ACT |\par \par \uc2 Public hearing scheduled in the inquiry into Workforce Australia Employment Services.\par \par \uc2 Sign up\par \par \uc2 If you would like to receive this Morning Mail update to your email inbox every weekday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2022/sep/23/morning-mail-newsletter-best-daily-news-email-guardian-australia-free-sign-up-inbox-subscribe?CMP=copyembed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sign up here}}}\uc2 . And finish your day with a three-minute snapshot of the day\u8217\'20\'19s main news. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2022/oct/13/afternoon-update-newsletter-best-daily-news-email-guardian-australia-free-sign-up?CMP=copyembed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sign up for our Afternoon Update newsletter here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Prefer notifications? If you\u8217\'20\'19re reading this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/ng-interactive/2018/may/15/the-guardian-app?CMP=copyembed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in our app}}}\uc2 , just {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/guardian-australia-s-morning-mail"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 click here and tap \u8220\'20\'1CGet notifications\u8221\'20\'1D on the next screen}}}\uc2  for an instant alert when we publish every morning.\par \par \uc2 Brain teaser\par \par \uc2 And finally, here are the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s crosswords to keep you entertained throughout the day \u8211\'20\'13 with plenty more on the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s Puzzles app for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apps.apple.com/app/id1487780661?mt=8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 iOS}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=uk.co.guardian.puzzles&hl=en_GB&gl=US"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Android}}}\uc2 . Until tomorrow.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/crosswords/quick/16618"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Quick crossword}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/crosswords/cryptic/29145"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptic crossword}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230810ej8a002s3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
