\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 AOC joins Hollywood picket line in New York: \u8216\'20\'18Solidarity is stronger than greed\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 412 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 July 2023\par 18:29 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Liberal congresswoman criticizes the wealth of studio executives as new contract negotiations remain at loggerheads\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/alexandria-ocasio-cortez"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez}}}\uc2  joined the picket line of film and television actors and writers represented by \uc2 Sag-Aftra\uc2  and WGA in front of \uc2 Netflix\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s New York City office on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The liberal congresswoman from New York criticized the wealth of studio executives as new contract negotiations between the \uc2 Alliance of Motion Picture and Television Producers\uc2  (\uc2 AMPTP\uc2 ) \u8211\'20\'13 which represents the studio bosses \u8211\'20\'13 and unions have been at loggerheads.\par \par \uc2 The Writers Guild of America (WGA), which represents about 11,500 film and television writers, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2023/may/02/thousands-of-hollywood-film-and-tv-writers-to-go-on-strike"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 began striking}}}\uc2  on 2 May. The US actors\u8217\'20\'19 union Sag-Aftra, which has 160,000 members, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2023/jul/14/the-hollywood-actors-strike-everything-you-need-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  their strike on 13 July.\par \par \uc2 Both unions are pushing for residuals from streaming services and terms on how the industry uses technology such as artificial intelligence. The strikes have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/business-news/los-angeles-shooting-days-plummet-writers-strike-1235539756/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halted }}}\uc2  the majority of film and television production in the US.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHow many private jets does \uc2 David Zaslav\uc2  need? For real. How many private jets do the CEOs need?\u8221\'20\'1D Ocasio-Cortez said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/business-news/aoc-picket-line-sag-aftra-wga-1235543857/#recipient_hashed=58e80303eb86ef6e1590496f3313a95182cb7e47e4431739bdb854b95b0768c7&recipient_salt=7e749829dd8fdacaf3affd4f51643a323740a6b6883a45b85c04133fdf95e512"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  on the picket line}}}\uc2 , referring to the CEO of \uc2 Warner Bros Discovery\uc2 , who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://variety.com/2023/tv/news/warner-bros-discovery-ceo-david-zaslav-pay-39-million-2022-1235568306/#:~:text=While%20Zaslav's%20pay%20is%20down,to%20a%20staggering%20%24246.6%20million."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 received}}}\uc2  a $246.6m compensation package in 2021.\par \par \uc2 As the Hollywood Reporter noted, Ocasio-Cortez continued: \u8220\'20\'1CIt is insatiable. It is unacceptable. I do not know how any person can say I need another $100m before another person can have healthcare.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Liz Shuler\uc2 , the president of the \uc2 American Federation of Labor and Congress of Industrial Organizations\uc2  (\uc2 AFL-CIO\uc2 ), the largest federation of unions in the US, also attended the picket line.\par \par \uc2 The picket line on Monday included high-profile actors such as Tatiana Maslany, Sandra Bernhard and F Murray Abraham.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have workers all across the country either currently on strike or gearing up to be on strike because at the end of the day we are all facing the same challenge, which is the concentration of wealth and corporate greed in America,\u8221\'20\'1D Ocasio-Cortez added.\par \par \uc2 She also expressed encouragement to workers on strike and emphasized the effect their strike is having on the labor movement throughout the US.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDirect action gets the goods, now and always,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CThe only way that we can do this is by showing them that we are stronger. That our solidarity is stronger than their greed, that our care for one another will overcome their endless desire for more.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230724ej7o0020e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
