\par\par \uc2 Film\par \b \uc2 Universal Studios denies trimming trees to expose strikers to heatwave\b0\par\par\uc2 Andrew Pulver \par \uc2 438 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2023\par 19:30 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 NBC Universal claims it is not trying to make conditions uncomfortable for writers and actors who will be picketing with no shade as temperatures soar\par \par \uc2 The Los Angeles city controller\u8217\'20\'19s office says it is investigating the trimming of tree branches on a stretch of roadway outside Universal Studios. The studio\u8217\'20\'19s owners NBC Universal have denied making conditions for striking actors and writers more difficult in the intense heat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/lacontroller/status/1681456457936687104"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In a series of posts on social media}}}\uc2 , LA city controller Kenneth Mejia initially wrote that the trees concerned are \u8220\'20\'1CLA City managed\u8221\'20\'1D, and that while public works agency StreetsLA are responsible for tree maintenance \u8220\'20\'1Ca business can also obtain a permit to trim a tree\u8221\'20\'1D. In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/lacontroller/status/1681690203013120001"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a later update}}}\uc2 , he added: \u8220\'20\'1CWith cooperation from the Bureau of Street Services, we have found that no tree trimming permits have been issued over the last three years for this location outside Universal Studios. Also, the City did not issue any tree trimming permits for the latest tree trimmings.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Strikers on picket outside Universal Studios\u8217\'20\'19 Gate 8, on Barham Blvd, first reported {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ChrisStephensMD/status/1681005154609545216"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the work on Monday}}}\uc2 , complaining that a line of ficus trees that had provided shade from what is forecast to this week become 33C (91F) heat had been severely cut back.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://deadline.com/2023/07/universal-pruned-ficus-trees-wga-picket-line-barham-boulevard-1235440896/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In a statement to Deadline}}}\uc2 , NBC Universal denied it had targeted strikers: \u8220\'20\'1CWe understand that the safety tree trimming of the ficus trees we did on Barham Blvd has created unintended challenges for demonstrators, that was not our intention. In partnership with licensed arborists, we have pruned these trees annually at this time of year \u8230\'20\'26 We support the WGA and Sag\u8217\'20\'19s right to demonstrate, and are working to provide some shade coverage.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 NBC Universal has also denied that it is refusing to create safe pathways for strikers around ongoing construction work on another part of its studio site, after the writers\u8217\'20\'19 union WGA and actors\u8217\'20\'19 union \uc2 Sag-Aftra{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/business-news/sag-wga-labor-board-grievance-nbcuniversal-1235539134/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed a complaint to the National Labor Relations Board (NLRB)}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The unions have complained that NBC Universal have not installed a temporary pedestrian lane in Lankershim Blvd, resulting in dangerous conditions for strikers attempting to maintain a protest there, and that \u8220\'20\'1Cpicketers [are forced] to patrol in busy streets with significant car traffic where two picketers have already been struck by a car\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In a statement NBC Universal said: \u8220\'20\'1CWe strongly believe that the company has fulfilled our legal obligations under the National Labor Relations Act (NLRA) and we will cooperate with respect to any inquiries by the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  on this issue.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230719ej7j001gy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
