\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 How likely is a \uc2 UPS\uc2  workers strike and how would it affect shipping?\b0\par\par\uc2 Lauren Aratani \par \uc2 886 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2023\par 11:09 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Negotiations between the US\u8217\'20\'19s largest shipping company and its union have stalled less than a month before the contract expires \u8211\'20\'13 here\u8217\'20\'19s what we know\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for negotiations to avert the largest strike against a single employer in US history. Contract negotiations between \uc2 UPS\uc2 , the largest shipping company in the US, and its workers\u8217\'20\'19 union have stalled less than a month before the union contract expires on 31 July. Without a contract, the union said that its 340,000 full- and part-time workers will strike, something that would significantly disrupt the US economy.\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what we know so far about negotiations and the potential strike:\par \par \uc2 Why are \uc2 UPS\uc2  workers potentially striking?\par \par \uc2 UPS\uc2  workers have been pushing for higher pay, more full-time jobs and better workplace health and safety conditions.\par \par \uc2 The company and its union have been in intense negotiations over its contract over the last month and have come to a few {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/ups-strike-labor-contract-teamsters-3438edf86cb006a1685e29822399a4d9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 agreements}}}\uc2 , including getting rid of its two-tier programs for drivers which means some part-time drivers are paid less than full-time drivers on an hourly basis. The company has also tentatively agreed to make Martin Luther King Jr Day a holiday and has agreed to install air-conditioning units in more of its trucks, since heat is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/08/ups-drivers-union-heat-temperatures-climate-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing hazard for drivers}}}\uc2  as temperatures continue to soar.\par \par \uc2 But the union for UPS Workers, \uc2 International Brotherhood of Teamsters\uc2 , known as \uc2 Teamsters\uc2 , said the company had not agreed to all of their demands.\par \par \uc2 In the early hours of 5 July, negotiations broke down with both sides saying that the other walked away from the negotiating table.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis multibillion-dollar corporation has plenty to give American workers \u8211\'20\'13 they just don\u8217\'20\'19t want to,\u8221\'20\'1D said the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  general president, Sean O\u8217\'20\'19Brien, in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://teamster.org/2023/07/after-marathon-sessions-ups-negotiations-collapse/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 UPS\uc2  had a choice to make, and they have clearly chosen to go down the wrong road.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  have stopped negotiating despite historic proposals that build on our industry-leading pay,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 UPS\uc2  said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://about.ups.com/us/en/newsroom/press-releases/people-led/ups-encourages-teamsters-to-return-to-the-negotiations-table.html#:~:text=We%20have%20not%20walked%20away,benefit%20from%20the%20Teamsters'%20actions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CRefusing to negotiate, especially when the finish line is in sight, creates significant unease among employees and customers and threatens to disrupt the US economy. Only our non-union competitors benefit from the \uc2 Teamsters\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 actions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 How likely is a strike at this point?\par \par \uc2 It is unclear when and if \uc2 UPS\uc2  and the union will go back to the negotiating table. Even before talks broke down, O\u8217\'20\'19Brien said that a strike appeared \u8220\'20\'1Cinevitable\u8221\'20\'1D. The stickiest point between the two parties appears to be over pay increases.\par \par \uc2 If the current contract ends up expiring on 31 July without a new one to take its place, the union could start its strike as early as 1 August. The \uc2 Teamsters\uc2  have been holding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Teamsters/status/1679482951002726411"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rallies }}}\uc2  and practice pickets around the US in preparation for the possible strike.\par \par \uc2 What happens if there is a strike?\par \par \uc2 There will probably be significant delays and increased costs in shipping around the country. \uc2 UPS\uc2  is the largest private shipping company in the country, just behind the \uc2 US Postal Service\uc2  (USPS) as the largest delivery company. The company handles about a fourth of all packages in the US, shipping 5.2bn parcels in 2022. \uc2 FedEx\uc2 , in comparison, shipped 4.1bn packages last year.\par \par \uc2 USPS and \uc2 FedEx\uc2  both released statements that essentially encouraged \uc2 UPS\uc2  customers to act fast and start using their services, in anticipation of a strike. USPS announced the launch of the USPS Ground Advantage program that offers coast-to-coast delivery in two to five days.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are ready to compete for an increased share of the growing package business,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Louis DeJoy\uc2 , US postmaster general, said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://about.usps.com/newsroom/national-releases/2023/0710-introducing-usps-ground-advantage.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 FedEx\uc2  said that the company\u8217\'20\'19s priority was \u8220\'20\'1Cprotecting capacity and service for existing customers\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTherefore, shippers who are considering shifting volume to \uc2 FedEx\uc2 , or are currently in discussions with the company to open a new account, are encouraged to begin shipping with \uc2 FedEx\uc2  now,\u8221\'20\'1D the company said.\par \par \uc2 Even though USPS and \uc2 FedEx\uc2  could take on some \uc2 UPS\uc2  customers, the companies will not be able to handle the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://investors.ups.com/company-profile"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 24.3m packages}}}\uc2 UPS\uc2  delivers a day in addition to their existing loads.\par \par \uc2 How will \uc2 UPS\uc2  be affected by a strike?\par \par \uc2 A 1997 UPS strike that lasted 15 days cost the company a total of $850m at the time. A \uc2 New York Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/1997/08/19/us/teamsters-and-ups-agree-on-a-5-year-contract-plan-to-end-strike-after-15-days.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  of the strike from 1997 said that small businesses struggled to restock their shelves, while hospitals had a hard time getting needed supplies. USPS and \uc2 FedEx\uc2  were overloaded with packages and cut overnight delivery services. And now, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/ECOMPCTSA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 e-commerce sales}}}\uc2  are over 15 times what they were then.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2023-06-28/ups-labor-talks-pit-wall-street-darling-against-fiery-union-boss?sref=fqqmZ8gi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimated}}}\uc2 UPS\uc2  could lose about $170m a day with the strike, based on its latest revenue reports. With the growth of online shopping during the pandemic, \uc2 UPS\uc2  has posted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2023/01/31/investing/ups-earnings/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record profits}}}\uc2  over the last two years, with revenue in 2022 reaching $100bn for the first time in the company\u8217\'20\'19s history. But the meteoric growth seen in the pandemic has slowed, and a potential strike has loomed over the company over the last few months. Given \uc2 UPS\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s share of the shipping industry, any major loss of customers will probably be temporary, but will still cost the company millions.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020230714ej7e001e8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
